<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TH" style="id">- BUU</book>
  <para style="h">1TH - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc1">1TH - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc2">1TH - BUU</para>
  <para style="toc3">1TH - BUU</para>
  <para style="mt1">1TH - BUU</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="s">Wa hu Izhi ri Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Mbe riwa wa Bulus, ri Sila nga Timoti wa ngan no wa hu Izhi ri Tasalonika, riwa a he wa A ti mbu Izhi nga Bachi Yeso Kristo:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 1:1">Ame Bulus me bre Izhi no dindi ti nga sisron no he ri yi.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ide ri Ngɨri ri Kpanyɨme Riwa wa nji Tasalonikawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Bla vi ki ngɨri ri Izhi ritu mbi wawu, ki yo nde mbi bla vi rimi ibre mbu. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Ki kuki ki ri tika mbi nde Bachi nga A ti mbu ri ndu riwa kpanyɨme mbi, ndu mbi a de nyɨme, ri vu sron a he rimi yosron rimi Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Imiri vayi, ki to ri Izhi nyɨme yi ran chu yi no yi he wa ma. <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />Ritu ki ngɨzhi tre dindi ye ri yi, a ran he tre ri nyu nkankshe ran, ama ri gbengbren nga Yuu Tsitsri ri nyɨme ri jaji wan. Bi to bibi son dindi riwa ki kii wayi. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Bi hu bibi ti mbu nga bibi ti riwa Izhi; ka hu ri bibi yaa riwa bi so, bi kpa tre Izhi ri kinklan sron riwa Iyu Tsitsri no yi. <verse eid="1TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Ritu kya riwa bi ti, wa nji Makidoniya ri wa nji Akaya wa hu bibi ti mbi. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Aran ri meme Makidoniya nga Akaya nye riwa itre Izhi riwa bi de a kri ri nkankshe ran, ama wa to tre kpanyɨme mbi bla bubu. Ritu ngamba ki ran ri tre kya ritu wan ngaran. <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />Ritu wa nji Makidoniya ri Akaya wa de tre ritu bibi hi mbu riwa ki hi ri yi. Ngha bibi riwa bi ka hu zhi riwa bi ran to-u ran chuwo bi ri kɨma ye ri Izhi ri vri nga ri kpunji, <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />biyi bi gben ye vren Izhi ri shu, riwa a ta shɨme ri kuu, wawu Yeso riwa a kpa ta chuwo ri fu Izhi riwa ari ye.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="s">Ndu Izhi Riwa Bulus a ti Ri Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Bi to miri vayi won, iye mbu ri yi ran he kuklu ran. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Bi to bibi riwa wa kra ta tu ri Filibi ko ki ye ri yi ri Tasalonika. Ka riwa wa nji mbi wa kamba ri ta ama ri dzon Izhi mbu ki la yi tre Izhi. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Itre Izhi riwa ki la a ran he yɨba nyu ran, a ran he ri meme ti ran, a ran he che ran. <verse eid="1TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Tsede bibi riwa Izhi tre ki tre nye ki la, ritu kita nye Izhi no ta tre raro ri ki tre. ki ran ri ti ritu no nji no wa yi ta ran ama ritu no sii Izhi sron, riwa a to sron mbu. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Bi to ki ran tɨretɨrewa che ko ki ka si mbi ran, Izhi he to mbu. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Ki ran wa no yi yii ta, ko ri njo ri nkan ran.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 2:6">Ka kita miri ndu Izhi ki ri he nchon ndu ri yii, <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />ama kita ki he rereri yi, ka iyi vren ri ya vren wan. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Ritu ki nyɨme yi bran ki ka ngambu no yi, a ran tre Izhi nkankshe riwa ki no yi ran nga ri sron mbu ngawen, ritu bi gra sron mbu bran. <verse eid="1TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Biyi miri vayi ko bi ya taka bibi yaa riwa ki so-a, ki ti ndu ri wo mbu ri chu ri ji, ritu ki ran no ko ngaa ya rimi mbi ran ri vi riwa ki ran la tre Izhi. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Biyi nga Izhi bi he ito mbu, ri bibi son ri Tsitsri, nga son tsra riwa a ran meme ran ri biyi wa hu Izhi wawu. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Biyi wawu bi to ki ti ri yi bibi riwa A ti ri ti ri miri wan. <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />Ki ŋoron yi, ki ri tre tre ri no yi sisron ki ri sondu la yi no yi sonson riwa ari si Izhi sron, riwa a yo yi hi ri kpanchison wan ri gbre. <verse eid="1TH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Ngha ki sondu ri ngɨri ri Izhi, ritu ka ki la tre Izhi ri yi bi ran kpa ka a he tre nji ran ama ritu a he tre Izhi, riwa ari ti ndu rimi mbi. <verse eid="1TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Biyi miri vayi, ikya riwa ari he ri yi, wawu nye a fe wa hu Izhi rimi Yudiya, bi so yaa ri wo wambi, bibi wan nye wa nji Yudiya wa so ri wo wa nji mba nji Yahuda. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />nji Yahuda-a nye wa wuu Yeso nga wa la tre Izhi wari dzu ta. Wa ran ran ti kya riwa Izhi nyɨme wu ran, nga wa ri yo wa nji wawu kusi, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />wa ran nyɨme no to ki tre tre Izhi ri kusi wawa wa ran to Izhi ran itre riwa ari ngɨzhi kpawa chuwo ye. Nghamba ngawen meme ti riwa wa ti a kigbu bran bran nfu Izhi ka ku ri wa ri kre wan.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bulus a wa ran Bru hi ri Tasalonika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Ama miri vayi won ri vi riwa ki ka ngambu don ivi hari, ki ka ka ngambu don ri kpa ama ki sondu ri taka mbi ri sron ki ri ran wa ki ri bru to yi. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Ki wa ki ri ye ri yi, ame Bulus me wa miri ye ri yi han nkpa riri ama meme nji a dzu ta. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Biyi nye, a ran njo ri nkan riwa bi he yosron mbu, kinklan sron mbu, bi ri he wawa ki wuru wo ri gbobre ritu mbi chachu riwa Bachi Yeso ri ye. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Kpunji tre ki wuru wo ri gbobre ritu mbi.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Ritu ngamba ki ran to vu sron ri ki kankan ngaran, ki ka ki ngambu ri Atina nkshe mbu. <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />Ame Bulus nga Sila ki ti Timoti ndu ri yi, riwa a he vayi mbu ran ri tindu la tre Bachi Kristo ri ta. Ki ti-u ndu no no yi tre ri de gbengbren ri yosron mbi, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />ritu no njo no ran bru ban gon ritu ya riwa ki to ri hu Izhi ran.Biyi kyumbi bi to ri iya riwa ki ti nyi a he ti Izhi nye ri ta. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Riwa ki he wa yi ri, ki la yi ri ki hi bubu so ya. Bi ye to a he ngamba nye. <verse eid="1TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Ritu nganyi nye me ti Timoti ndu ri yi. Me ran to vu sron ran nye me ri ti-u ndu no ye ya kpanyɨme mbi to. Me ti sisri ritu ka meme nji gyuru yi no ndu mbu he kuklu.<verse eid="1TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Timoti a Ghɨron</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Ama ngye ngan zizan Timoti a dzu ri yi ye, nga ran la ta tre dindi ritu kpa nyɨme mba nyɨme mbi. A la ta ri bi tika dindi ritu mbu nga wuri wa wu to ta bibi riwa kita ki wa ki ri to-u. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Ritu ngamba Imiri vayi won ri bibi yaa riwa ki so-a ritu yo sron mbi ki fe senkpa. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Zizan ki he ri si, riwa bi kabru tu ritu Bachi. <verse eid="1TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Ngɨri bibi tan ki ti ri Izhi ritu mbi ritu kinklan sron mbu riwa ki he ri wu ri kusi Izhi ritu mbi? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Ri ji ri chu ki bre Izhi bran bran riwa ki bru to yi nga ki ri bru tre tre riwa ari no yi senkpa rimi kpanyɨme mbi. <verse eid="1TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />No A ti mbu Izhi kyuwan nga no Bachi Yeso no milan nkon ti ri ta riwa ki ye ri wu. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />No Bachi no no yi nyɨme ngambi bran nga ngbron nji. Bibi riwa kita ki nyɨme yi bran bran. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Ki ibreno Bachi no no sron mbi senkpa riwa wa ran ya yi ka wa meme ti ran nga bi ri he Tsitsri ri kusi Izhi mbu nga A ti mbu chachu riwa Bachi Yeso ri ye ri wa Tsitsri wan wawu.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s">Ison Bibi Riwa Izhi Nyɨme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1" />Ri kre wan, miri vayi ki la yi no yi ki bibi ki riwa ari bi ri Izhi. Rinyi he kya riwa bi si ti sisen mu. Ngha bibi riwa ki ibreyi rimi nde Bachi Yeso riwa bi ti han ngamba. <verse eid="1TH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:2" />Ritu bi to tre riwa ki la yi a he rimi senkpa Bachi Yeso nye. <verse eid="1TH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3" />Izhi riwa a no yi son ri Tsitsri nga bi ri ka kru ri mba nji chuwo. <verse eid="1TH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:4" />Ko ngan rimi mbi no to bibi son riwa wa son mba wa wan rimi Tsitsri nga son riwa wa no wa nkpen, <verse eid="1TH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />ran ya mba nji bi ri timbye bibi wawa wa ran to Izhi ran, <verse eid="1TH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />no njo no ran wa waa vayi wan ran, ko no sen wu ran, Ritu ki la yi tre nyi nga ki ri fen yi ton bran ri Bachi ri no wa ya. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Izhi ran yo ta ki ti ndu wan ri zhi ri sron ran, ama ri Tsitsri sron. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Nji riwa a kawan ri kpa tre nyi a ran kawan ri tre nji ran ama a kawan ri tre Izhi riwa ari no ta Yuu Tsitsri nye.<verse eid="1TH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Ritu tre nyɨme ngambi, a ran he riwa tse wa la yi ran ritu Izhi gbuchi tsro yi bibi riwa bi ŋɨme ngambi. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Bi gbuchi nyɨme nji ri ngbron bubu bibi riwa wawu nji wa Makidoniya. Ki he rimi ibre yi no yi sondu ti ngamba ran hi. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Ki ibreyi no yi ka sron mbi yo bubu ri bi ri ti kya riwa bi ti ri wo mbi no dzon yi, bibi riwa ki la yi, <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />ri ti nganyi bi fe nkpen ri wawa wa ran to Izhi ran, bi ran yo si ri njo ritu kya riwa bi wa ran.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iye Bachi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Ama miri vayi mbu, ki wa no yi to kpunji tre ritu wawa wa kuu, ritu bi ri ran kpa sron mbi time ran, bibi wa wawa wa ran he ri yo sron ran. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ki kpa nyɨme ri Yeso Izhi ri ta wawa wa kuu shɨme no wa ye ri wu iwawa. <verse eid="1TH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />Ki la bibi riwa Bachi a tre, wawa wa kuu wa gbuchi tashɨme wa ri hi fe Yeso ri ko kita wawa ki he ri sii. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ritu Bachi ri tuwan ri gɨzhi ri shu ye ri mme, ri raan ri gbangban, ri raan rinkon wa la tre Izhi, nga ri rangan yo wa Izhi nga wa hu Izhi wawa wa kuu wa gbuchi tashɨme. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Kugon ri mba, kita wawa ki he ri si ri ki kabru iwawa ri shu wulu ki ri fe Bachi ri bubu wan. Ri bubu wan ki kii ri Bachi hari hi. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Rimba ki no ngambu tre ri de senkpa.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Miri vayi, a ran he riwa ki la yi vi ko chachu riwa kyawa wa nyi wa ti ran, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />ritu biyi kyumbi bi to ivi ye Bachi ri ye ka iye nji ri yɨbi ri chu. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Ka nji wa tre, &lt;&lt;Kongye mbi ri ran tsra,&gt;&gt; Imba mgbumgblu mme ri kre bibi riwa iyi nne ri ye ri wa, nga njo ran jɨbu ran. <verse eid="1TH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Ama biyi miri vayi bi ran he rimi bu riwa ivi nyi ri ye ri yi ka iye nji ri yɨbi ran. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ritu biyi wawu mbi bi he ri kpan nga ri ji. Ki ran he wa chu ko wa bu ran. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Ritu ngamba, ki ran ran krunna ka wawa wa ran ri hu Izhi ran; Ki kii ri gben nga ki ri milan ngambu ya. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />A he ri chu nye nji wa krunna; nga ri chu nye nji wa hua. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Ama ki he wa kpan, nga ki ri ki kpen. Ki yo sron ri nyɨme ka bibi tsro ri ti ku, nga yo sron ri kpachuwo ka kuta ri ti ku. <verse eid="1TH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Izhi ran yo ta ritu ran no ta ya ran, ama ritu ki fe kpa chuwo dzu ri wo Bachi Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />Yeso Kristo kuu ritu mbu ritu ki ri hi kii ri wu, ko ki he sii ka ki kuu ri vi riwa ari ye. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Ngha bi ri no ngambi tre ri de senkpa nga bi ri dzon ngambi, bibi riwa bi ti zizan.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nghɨron Ngha Tre ri Kre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Zizan ki ibreyi miri vayi, no wawa wa ti ndu Izhi rimi mbi mkpen. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Milan wa ngɨzhi ri nyɨme ritu ndu riwa wa ti. Ki ri sisron rimi mbi. <verse eid="1TH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Ki la yi tre nyi biyi miri vayi, fen wawa wa ki kuklu ton, no wa sisri tre ri sisron, dzon wawa wa ran senkpa ran, bi ri vu sron ri ko nga. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Milan ya ka njo ti meme ti ri wu ran ti zhula riwu ran. Ama bi ti dindi ti ri ngambi nga ri nji wawu. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Ti kinklan sron bla vi, <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Sondu ran bre Izhi, <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />ngye kya riwa Izhi ri wa ri yi, bi ngɨri ri wu bla vi, a he ti Izhi rimi Yeso Kristo nye no he ngamba. <verse eid="1TH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />kpa kya riwa Iyu Tsitsri ri la yi; <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />ran tsri tre riwa a zhu ri nyu wa la tre Izhi ran. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Ama tsra kongye bi ri ngɨzhi riwa a tsra gbengben. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Ka meme ti ri bibi tan chuwo.<verse eid="1TH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />Ki ibreno Izhi ri tuwan, wawu Bachi ri ngɨzhi son ri si ye no tsrii yi ri ko nkon ri tan wu mbi wawu nga sron mbi, nga kpa mbi no son ri Tsitsri hi ri chachu ye Yeso Kristo. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Izhi riwa a yo yi rimi ndu nyi ari ti ri yi.<verse eid="1TH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Miri vayi bre Izhi ri ta ngawen. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Chi ngambi ri bibi vu wa hu Izhi. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />Ame Bulus me ibreyi rimi nde Bachi no yi kra mbe nyi ri wawa wa hu Izhi wawu. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Ki ibreno dindi ti Bachi mbu Yeso Kristo no he ri yi.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>